Before coming to coaching, Norm had been working in the technology industry, leading
change and improvement as both an individual and as a manager, for his own team as well
as for the organization. He has experience leading and working across cultures and
timezones. He has led teams through mission scope change, implementation of Agile methodology,
adoption of AI tooling, and a 40x improvement of delivery time.

This breadth of experience, his love of learning, and his ability to listen and ask the hard
questions of you, can help you to discover and articulate your own leadership style, strengths,
and weakness, and to find your own authenticity in your career. 
